  "details": "Usually when trying to attach a static object to a skinned mesh between bones.  I add both bones and blend between based on the vertex weights.  But since each vertex on a skinned mesh isnt a simple average weighted blend it doenst always align.\n\nI propose a simple toggle button that switches the operation of the constraint to match the skinned mesh renderes transformation from armature.  Unsure how this would be implemented, but it would be quite useful!  Even if it was a separate components just for this purpose.",
